      187.15,
      226.97,
      397.19,
      262.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cDeputy Mayor\u201d means the Deputy Mayor of aMunicipal Council or the Vice-Chairman of anUrban Council or a Pradeshiya Sabha; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      187.15,
      274.97,
      397.18,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cMayor\u201d means the Mayor of a Municipal Councilor the Chairman of an Urban Council or aPradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      322.97,
      397.2,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "6.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
